{
    "title": "Wood Number - Match Ten Games",
    "description": "Dive into the addictive world of Wood Number, a captivating offline game where your number matching skills are put to the test. With simple rules, the goal is to clear the grid by finding pairs of numbers that are either identical or sum to 10. Perfect for fans of number puzzles, this game challenges you to match numbers in a grid and achieve the highest score.\r\n\r\nThe game also features helpful tools to assist you in your quest to become a number puzzle master:\r\n - Add Rows \u2795: Introduce multiple new rows to the grid.\r\n - Undo \u21a9\ufe0f: Revert your last move to try a different strategy.\r\n - Hint \ud83d\udd0d: Receive a clue to guide you to the next match.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\ud83d\udc8e\r\n\r\n - Easy to learn\u2764\ufe0f\r\n - Special boosters like Hints, Undo\ud83e\uddd0\r\n - Free to play and no wifi needed.\r\n - Complete Daily challenges to get unique trophies\ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\n\r\nWood Number is a standout among number games like 2048 and Sudoku, also known as Numberama, Number Match, and Take Ten. This easy mind game can be played online, offline, or on mobile devices, making it perfect for on-the-go fun. Solving a number puzzle daily boosts logic, memory, and math skills. Though it's not as simple as it looks, Wood Number is praised for its addictive and relaxing gameplay, helping players unwind after a long day. Try Wood Number now and experience why it\u2019s one of the most engaging number games out there!\r\n\r\nWhether you are a casual player or a dedicated puzzle enthusiast, Wood Number offers a perfect blend of fun and challenge. Enjoy the game offline anytime, anywhere, and test your skills to become a champion of number games. Download Wood Number today and immerse yourself in the ultimate number puzzle experience!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into the addictive world of Wood Number, a captivating offline game where your number matching skills are put to the test. With simple rules, the goal is to clear the grid by finding pairs of numbers that are either identical or sum to 10. Perfect for fans of number puzzles, this game challenges you to match numbers in a grid and achieve the highest score.<br><br>The game also features helpful tools to assist you in your quest to become a number puzzle master:<br> - Add Rows \u2795: Introduce multiple new rows to the grid.<br> - Undo \u21a9\ufe0f: Revert your last move to try a different strategy.<br> - Hint \ud83d\udd0d: Receive a clue to guide you to the next match.<br><br><br><b>Features</b>\ud83d\udc8e<br><br> - Easy to learn\u2764\ufe0f<br> - Special boosters like Hints, Undo\ud83e\uddd0<br> - Free to play and no wifi needed.<br> - Complete Daily challenges to get unique trophies\ud83c\udfc6<br><br><br>Wood Number is a standout among number games like 2048 and Sudoku, also known as Numberama, Number Match, and Take Ten. This easy mind game can be played online, offline, or on mobile devices, making it perfect for on-the-go fun. Solving a number puzzle daily boosts logic, memory, and math skills. Though it&#39;s not as simple as it looks, Wood Number is praised for its addictive and relaxing gameplay, helping players unwind after a long day. Try Wood Number now and experience why it\u2019s one of the most engaging number games out there!<br><br>Whether you are a casual player or a dedicated puzzle enthusiast, Wood Number offers a perfect blend of fun and challenge. Enjoy the game offline anytime, anywhere, and test your skills to become a champion of number games. Download Wood Number today and immerse yourself in the ultimate number puzzle experience!",
